{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8000_place", "source_sha256": "97e0651ef2a00b2eac29ed77bf819783fd01012cccbd22aebe71dd5609455e67", "ja": "スタンディングバー", "zh": "站立式酒吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8001_p", "source_sha256": "d653236b33a999978f2a48e221db7f35af8a08b732c2b3a6c1f254c599f8f16c", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n企画の撮影日。美也のテーマは『バーテンダー』だ）", "zh": "（今天是为偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍摄写真企划。美也的主题是“调酒师”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8002_042miy", "source_sha256": "b0fcbcbc4639e4408d53335fe1d37b8e90dd055d40a3de53792ac598a1c490b7", "ja": "{$P$}さん～。\nリハーサルをしたいんですけど、今いいですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n我想先排练一下，现在方便吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8003_p", "source_sha256": "140cca166b51c61eefff60d17a21cb61ecf24cbb269bce7887c2281b8dd29e1e", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nでも、リハーサルってなにをするんだ？", "zh": "啊，当然可以。\n不过，彩排要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8004_042miy", "source_sha256": "0e0990bc0b26ee4b84563cff330aba1678ff813a35ee78410d6ebf07c92e0c83", "ja": "飲み物を渡す練習ですよ～。バーには色々なお客さんが\n来ると聞きますから。相手役をお願いしたいんです。", "zh": "是练习把饮料递给客人哦～。听说酒吧里会来各种各样的客人。所以想请您来扮演对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8005_p", "source_sha256": "1f46450cb108c195bb66cea96d37b4282b030096c1ee8f51aab6e3608998367b", "ja": "なるほどな。本番でいい表情を撮るための\n練習ってことか。よし、どんと来い！", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，这是为了在正式演出时拍到好表情而进行的练习吧。好，尽管放马过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8006_042miy", "source_sha256": "7ad06ce3c06ce2af9e69622c61e12ce48ad513cc021d54a5f7e6fa59fc3730bb", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\nでは、さっそくはじめますよ～。", "zh": "谢谢啦～  \n那么，我们马上开始吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8007_042miy", "source_sha256": "bea6c8db710f7912f78a0acd166590c1f08a0d0b0dc56c215246abaab314c96a", "ja": "「お待たせしました～。こちら、\nあなたにおすすめのほろにがドリンクです～」", "zh": "“让您久等了～。这杯，\n是特别推荐给您的微苦特饮哦～”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8008", "source_sha256": "5cf9a7166db35090ff9f0f77b9e32c04114154ec5c04fbb64ff6c232ea2df389", "ja": "これだよこれ！", "zh": "就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8009", "source_sha256": "21b2ba1811e66eef3e01a48e589b379c48c9efa25b3a8354c7e883e04351ba73", "ja": "ありがとうございます", "zh": "谢谢你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8010", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8100_p", "source_sha256": "05c5d2e921a3bbddad642c301be35f005397c26385f93334e07f16c4754d2f04", "ja": "「くぅ～、やっぱり仕事の後のほろにがドリンクが\n一番だ！　このために生きてるってもんだ！」", "zh": "“啊～，果然还是工作后的微苦饮料最棒！人活着就是为了这个啊！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8101_042miy", "source_sha256": "aeddeac52bc5be93355fd72bef6a6f2e5748195d7efbe1d6be14487ac8650bcd", "ja": "おー。{$P$}さん、\nとっても役に入り込んでますな～。", "zh": "哦——。{$P$}先生，真是完全沉浸在角色里了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8102_042miy", "source_sha256": "a6713ec3f15fa804ee442077a19c601768e44608a8cd5faf069954a12dbfed44", "ja": "ふふっ、私も負けていられません。本番では\n立派なバーテンダーとして、頑張ります～。むんっ。", "zh": "呵呵，我也不能输给您。正式演出时，我会努力成为一名出色的调酒师～。嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8200_p", "source_sha256": "e4af36098a0533c431dfc8c3d5a84c718dacfae8e9e2c9cfa43f937b91469171", "ja": "「これが、ほろにがドリンクですか。\n初めて飲みます。どうもありがとう」", "zh": "“这就是微苦饮料吗？\n我还是第一次喝。非常感谢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8201_042miy", "source_sha256": "1ece5e17ce4061dfd061e59bb5e096c6d277805318f4f95fdb114e0526368a86", "ja": "「いえいえ、ゆっくりしていってくださいね～」\n……じーっ。", "zh": "“不用客气，请好好放松一下吧～”\n……盯——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8202_p", "source_sha256": "5990893104a671f53e982bb75e96e9fade16f3e90237d8f58ef4371c873bf148", "ja": "「ごくっ……あっ。おいしい！」", "zh": "「咕嘟……啊。真好喝！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8203_042miy", "source_sha256": "0e2c4e37753573a850fd435d24404ce6a903967b70a1b60f3651b63d9ea69991", "ja": "よかったです～。私のおすすめで、笑顔になるのは\n嬉しいような、ちょっと恥ずかしいような……むふふ♪", "zh": "太好了～。您因为我的推荐而露出了笑容，\n让人觉得既高兴，又有点不好意思呢……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8300_p", "source_sha256": "58a7b27e2f2890a95254b4cb23fa8d04c9502334be88b328f91f70431cf0404e", "ja": "「えっと……\n甘口ドリンクを注文したはずなんですけど……」", "zh": "“那个……\n我记得我点的是甜饮料来着……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8301_042miy", "source_sha256": "1ab37b2c31ad76e1b726c3dc68d4b88a7458edbbfd37e9a54b738ba3f6322fcc", "ja": "「なんと～。間違えてしまったみたいです……。\nすみません。すぐにお持ちしますね～」", "zh": "「哎呀～好像不小心弄错了……。\n对不起，我马上给您拿来～」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_8302_042miy", "source_sha256": "edb7464bc5b2a40e74514ff3ead3ed0eddd7b26d3ecf4892ad53a291ac6401a6", "ja": "……ふむふむ。どんな事態にも対応しないといけないん\nですね。バーテンダーのお仕事は大変ですな～。", "zh": "……嗯嗯～。看来无论遇到什么情况都得应对才行呢。调酒师的工作还真是辛苦呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
